    181  2eca
    182  2eca							; The vibrato, glide and detune the SID uses (FxTick, voices.asm). Each is
    183  2eca							; the menu's choice: AS SOUND (the sound's), ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values),
    184  2eca							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    185  2eca							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    186  2eca							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
    187  2eca				   FxVars
    188  2eca					      subroutine
    189  2eca		       ae 95 c3 	      ldx	soundMode
    190  2ecd							; ---- vibrato
    191  2ecd		       ac 06 c6 	      ldy	vibLock
